     1	#!/usr/bin/env python3
     2	"""Qualify opt-in whole-K Marlin against identical-row batch placement.
     3	
     4	No model load. The fixed contract is y[t,k] = x[t] @ dequant(W[expert[t,k]]),
     5	then SiLU(gate)*up, then down @ dequant(V[expert[t,k]]) * route_weight[t,k],
     6	and a fixed-order top10 sum. Every expert uses the same independently generated
     7	W/V, so changing other rows or routing cannot change the target's real-valued
